Subject: [PATCH 20/45] inkling2: tf-inkling2-engine timing

Times graphed windows by rows (one stream, 1-8 rows) and shared windows
(2, 4 and 8 streams of 1, 2, 4 and 8 rows), the draft pass for 1, 2, 4
and 8 streams, and a keep of one row out of eight by rewind and by the
old re-run: the median of 16 calls after 3 warm ones, rows of real text.
It prints the lone table in the shape lanes' window_costs take.
